{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CeseWSQBBvhWSMLJDTkU3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've successfully implemented the confirm shipment endpoint. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\n**Modified Files:**\n1. **ShipmentController.kt** - Added `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint with the following logic:\n   - Returns 404 if shipment doesn't exist\n   - Returns 409 (Conflict) if shipment is CANCELLED\n   - Transitions shipment from CREATED to CONFIRMED and persists it\n   - Returns the shipment unchanged if already CONFIRMED (idempotent)\n\n2. **ApiError.kt** - Added `SHIPMENT_ALREADY_CANCELLED` error code to the ErrorCode enum\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 5 comprehensive tests:\n   - Confirms a created shipment and returns CONFIRMED status\n   - Verifies the confirmed status is persisted\n   - Tests idempotency (repeated confirms succeed)\n   - Tests 404 response for unknown shipments\n   - Tests 409 response for cancelled shipments\n\n## Test Results\n✅ All 18 tests pass (5 existing + 5 new shipment tests + 4 order tests + 3 customer tests + 1 app test)\n✅ No new Maven dependencies added\n✅ Only shipment-related files modified\n✅ Build succeeds\n\nAll acceptance criteria are met!"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":289,"cache_read_input_tokens":40733,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":289},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"782d60db-4d8a-49ba-b7de-9a534d12081e","uuid":"e5fb54d8-cb75-4492-aa9e-84fe04eb2e4a","timestamp":"2026-09-09T09:42:38.535Z","request_id":"req_011CeseWRdYPASrYBM7RpZkr"}
